## 1. UNSPSC taxonomy — `samples/unspsc-v26-en.csv.gz`

**Source:** UNSPSC v26.0801 English codeset, © United Nations Development
Programme (UNDP). Distributed free of charge by UNDP via
<https://www.undp.org/unspsc>.

**What is bundled:** the English-language baseline codeset — 149,849 8-digit
commodity codes with their segment, family and class membership. No substantive
modification has been made to the taxonomy; the only transformations are
technical (flattening the hierarchy into one denormalised CSV row per commodity,
and concatenating synonym/acronym columns into the description). Redistribution is
therefore of the unmodified baseline codeset.

**Provenance chain:** obtained from the `unspsc-fr` bilingual distribution
(<https://github.com/codebysaadbouh/unspsc-fr>, data version `v26.0801`), whose
English rows are themselves sourced from UNDP (`source = "UNDP-v260801"` in that
project's dataset).

