## 2. UNSPSC-derived example data — `samples/suppliers.csv`, `samples/transactions.csv`

Synthetic sample data authored for this repository, for testing and demonstration
only. Company names are real trademarks used descriptively to exercise
parent/subsidiary resolution (for example Dell Technologies and its subsidiaries).
**The spend amounts are invented** and do not represent any organisation's actual
procurement, contracts, or commercial relationships. The MIT license applies to
these files.

